message: "If you use this model or benchmark, please cite it as below, and cite the Qwen3 Technical Report for the base model."
title: "Privify AI Act Risk-Tier Classifier"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Privify-Inc/aiact-tier"
authors:
